  "R4_sign": "the paired direction holds iff at least 60% of pairs move the same way; the separation word holds iff the worst of one cadence still beats the best of the other on matched calendars",
  "R5_calendar": "the calendar term for a cell is the level step between the first and the second half of that cell's own offsets; if it is the same size as the cadence gap, the gap is not attributable to cadence alone",
